  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining the scope**\n\nI\'m currently focused on defining the precise scope for a comprehensive food waste management platform in Portuguese. This entails listing key features and functionalities requested by the user. I\'m prioritizing essential components for waste prevention and optimization.\n\n\n**Detailing the functionalities**\n\nI\'ve been meticulously detailing the required features for the Portuguese food waste platform. I\'m focusing on specific functionalities such as comprehensive waste recording (food type, quantity, location), waste classification into categories, economic analysis with cost estimations, performance indicators including CO2 emissions, and automated alerts for various scenarios like expiring products or waste limit breaches, and stock management.\n\n\n**Expanding the Feature Set**\n\nI\'m now integrating comprehensive functionalities for waste diversion and management. This encompasses surplus food donation management with Food Bank integration, tracking sustainable waste destinations like composting, and robust features for HACCP compliance, food safety, and traceability. Additionally, I\'m working on generating automated reports and enabling data export in Excel and PDF formats, along with integrating AI for waste prediction and recommendations.\n\n\n"
