  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Planning UI Components**\n\nOkay, I\'m now structuring the UI with modular components in `/src/components/`, ensuring comprehensive coverage of all requirements. First up, I\'m mapping the component tree, beginning with `Header.tsx`, which will act as the navigation bar, encompassing tabs for Dashboard, Registo, Economia & KPIs, Stocks FEFO, and other key areas.\n\n\n**Defining Dashboard Components**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the `DashboardView.tsx` components. Key elements include KPI cards (Res\303\255duos Hoje, Perda Econ\303\263mica, etc.) and a \"Quanto dinheiro se perdeu\" module with a savings calculator. I\'m prioritizing the AI prediction banner to highlight potential waste, alongside a monthly trend chart and charts for wasted products and sector loss breakdown.\n\n\n**Structuring Waste Log View**\n\nI\'m now detailing `WasteLogView.tsx`, focusing on waste entry tables and the registration modal. I\'m incorporating multiple filters for the waste entries: search query, category, type, location, and date range. The table columns will display Date/Time, Food Item, Category, Type, Quantity, Cost, CO\342\202\202e, Location, Responsible, and Actions. The \"+ Registar Res\303\255duo\" modal will feature real-time cost and CO\342\202\202 calculations based on user input, along with preset buttons for frequently registered items.\n\n\n**Designing Stock Control**\n\nI\'m now detailing `StockFefoView.tsx`, focusing on inventory tracking. I\'m prioritizing FEFO status flags and storage type filters for easy identification. The action buttons will enable quick operations like donations and breakage registrations. A stock movement history is crucial to track inventory fluctuations.\nI am also starting the `DonationView.tsx` with a partner directory and donation log, prioritizing the creation of a streamlined receipt generator.\nI\'ve also begun sketching out the `ValorizationView.tsx` for tracking circular economy initiatives and their impact metrics.\n\n\n**Expanding Feature Set**\n\nI\'m now detailing `ValorizationView.tsx`, focusing on circular economy initiatives. I am prioritizing a new \"+ Registar Valoriza\303\247\303\243o / Compostagem\" modal, to track organic fertilizer generated in kilograms, CO\342\202\202 savings, and waste diverted from landfills.\nI\'m starting the `HaccpView.tsx` with logs for food safety, including rejected product entries with reasons, non-conformity registry, and batch traceability.\nI am implementing a \"+ Registar Rejei\303\247\303\243o HACCP\" modal. I\'ve also outlined `AIPredictionsView.tsx` for AI integration, and the generator for live forecasts from Gemini 3.6 Flash.\nI am focused on procurement recommendations now. I\'m also including a chat consultor.\nI am including automated reports and alerts.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 11
      nanos: 924996363
    }
